<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A4106014002" page = "2">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A4106015">Brake Flexible Hose and Pipe Inspection</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure noting the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten flare nuts to specified torque referring to 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A4106013">Brake Flexible Hose and Pipe Components</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Install all removed clamps properly.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
