</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
K14D model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1726001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list3>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Adjust parking brake cable, if removed. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A4406003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
If liquid hose and suction pipe are removed, evacuate and charge A/C system referring to “Evacuation” and “Charge” in 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A7206001">Operation Procedure for Refrigerant Charge</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
If heater inlet hose and outlet hose are removed, check cooling system for leakage.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
K14C model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1616003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
K14D model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1626003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
If fuel feed pipe, purge pipe and/or fuel tank are removed, check fuel line connections for leakage with engine not running and ignition “ON”.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
K14C model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1716004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
K14D model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1726004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check that steering wheel is in straight-forward position and flexible hoses are not twisted or kinked.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check that flexible hose is not in contact with any part of suspension when steering wheel is turned fully right and left.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Bleed brake system. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A4106004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
If clutch fluid pipe is removed, bleed clutch system. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5306007"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check that brake system operates properly and there is no fluid leakage.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
